{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdZ6LdJLDDkg5vuko8RY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Zest's new text-message concierge books tables through connected services such as OpenTable, Resy and SevenRooms, so the reservation itself happens on systems that restaurants and diners already use. What Zest adds sits in front of them: a conversation in which users can ask for places by cuisine, craving, occasion, dietary restrictions or neighborhood, ask how busy a restaurant may be or whether it has Wi-Fi, request the menu, and then hear the available booking times.\n\nThat arrangement shapes the business. CEO Mario Gomez-Hall says booking and ordering are the first revenue lines, that Zest books through OpenTable or Resy today, that food ordering is coming, and that there are transactions in which Zest can participate. The article does not say how Zest is paid for those transactions or what terms it has with the booking platforms, so the size and durability of that revenue cannot be judged from what has been reported. It is also an inference, not something the article states, that Zest depends on those platforms staying connected.\n\nOn the product side, TechCrunch's tests found that the AI worked fairly well, producing suggestions for new places that fit its tastes and constraints like time of day, party size and location. TechCrunch added that finding an open table is something other apps have offered for years. The case for Zest therefore rests on how well its suggestions are personalized, which the company says comes from users' food and drink card transactions, and on the convenience of handling the whole decision in one thread."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1069,"cache_read_input_tokens":6311,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1069},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5f6f2469-b340-40e3-afd3-e0991fea34a9","uuid":"12f31c10-6194-4433-9c76-bc9f867e4ce5","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:32:14.153Z","request_id":"req_011CgdZ6LReDr1rT84f7JBmd"}
